{
  "name": "OpenWA RAG - Multimodal + PGVector",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OpenWA RAG Multimodal\n\nVersion inspirada en tu workflow complejo.\n\nSoporta:\n- texto\n- audio\n- imagen\n\nFlujo:\n1. recibe webhook de OpenWA\n2. normaliza payload\n3. convierte audio o imagen a texto\n4. consulta RAG en pgvector\n5. responde por OpenWA en texto\n\nNota: la salida de voz se omitio a proposito para priorizar estabilidad. Si quieres TTS despues, solo falta agregar credencial de ElevenLabs u OpenAI TTS.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "openwa/rag-multimodal/inbound",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-openwa",
      "name": "Webhook OpenWA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        460
      ],
      "webhookId": "openwa-rag-multimodal-inbound"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "from-me",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.body.data.fromMe}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ignore-own-message",
      "name": "Ignore Own Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "session",
